  "change_explanation": "Publishes the comparison fixture's preparation as one set: 4 places, 6 actors, 5 events, 4 relationships, and 1 story, with the 4 cited sources pinned. The set publishes the corrected revisions the internal review prepared and the label positions the owner's 2026-09-25 report led to: the submission's display placement at the Han capital the hereditary house records, and label anchors for the death at 雲陽 and the annexation at the 潁川 commandery, each resting on the cited historical geography's identification and placed at the modern place that carries the name. 南陽 stays without a position because the entries state no extent or seat and the name covers two regions in that historical geography. A second review round corrected a 南陽府 locator and two event phrasings (the cession's dating and the annexation's anchor wording) as new revisions. No place carries an asserted coordinate. The set records the preparing editor's self-review only: no owner decision exists for this content, it is comparison-only rather than a launch chapter, and RFD 4's AC2 does not apply to it.",
